   (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/)."

If you modify it, say so. If you include Far Cry 3 material of any kind, keep
PART B visible as well, and do not imply that Ubisoft, Cryo, or the original
editor authors are connected with your work or have endorsed it.

